<task id="043" project="email-communication-intelligence-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>Unify user-upload ("Save to Spaarke") with the capture pipeline — same engine + dedup (FR-B3)</title>
    <phase>4 Pillar B — Unified filing surfaces</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies BFF Office upload code (`Services/Office/**`, .cs) to route through the Communication engine + dedup; resolves the structural capture-vs-upload split. tags include bff-api + communication. FULL per task-create Step 3.5.5 → code-review + adr-check at Step 9.5.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Well-specified re-routing of an existing upload path onto the existing engine + existing dedup (C1) + existing attachment-hash detector (C3); Sonnet 5 default (CLAUDE.md §8.5). The hard race/crypto logic lives in C1/C3, not here.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
